@startuml Matchday Inputs Outputs Overview
title Matchday V5 - Vista general de entradas y salidas

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Team API" as TeamApi
component "Match Lifecycle API" as LifecycleApi
component "Match Event API" as EventApi
component "Query API" as QueryApi

artifact "Team / Player requests" as TeamInput
artifact "Match configuration" as MatchInput
artifact "Timed event requests" as EventInput
artifact "Summary / Detail responses" as Output

TeamInput --> TeamApi
MatchInput --> LifecycleApi
EventInput --> EventApi
TeamApi --> Output
LifecycleApi --> Output
EventApi --> Output
QueryApi --> Output

note bottom of TeamApi
  Ver api/teams.puml
end note
note bottom of LifecycleApi
  Ver api/match-lifecycle.puml
end note
note bottom of EventApi
  Ver api/match-events.puml
end note
note bottom of QueryApi
  Ver api/match-queries.puml
end note
@enduml
